### Send video request
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/processing/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="REC6766379630202934727.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< C:/Users/matke/Videos/testVideo11.mp4
--WebAppBoundary--

### Video Processing status
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/processing/status/13

### Analyze video
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/analysis/analyze?recording-id=13
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "arm_movement": true,
  "eye_contact": true,
  "pitch": true,
  "volume": true,
  "hip": true,
  "filler_words": true
}
### Video Processing - Extract pose landmarks from video
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/video/1/analyze/

### Audio Processing - Extract, normalize, and resample audio
POST http://localhost:8004/api/v1/audio/8/analyze/

### Transcript Processing MS - Health Check
# @timeout 60 m
POST http://localhost:8009/api/v1/13/transcribe/

