# Analysis Endpoints
###############################################

### Pitch Analysis - Analyze pitch from processed audio
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/pitch/5/analyze/

### Pitch Timeseries - Get pitch timeseries data
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/pitch/5/timeseries/

### Volume Analysis - Analyze volume from processed audio
POST http://localhost:8006/api/v1/volume/5/analyze/

### Arm Movement Analysis - Analyze wrist kinematics and gestures
POST http://localhost:8002/api/v1/analyze/arm-movements/49/

### Eye Contact Analysis - Analyze gaze patterns
POST http://localhost:8003/api/v1/eye-contact/47/analyze/

### Hip Analysis - Analyze hip movement and sway
POST http://localhost:8007/api/v1/hip/49/analyze/

### Filler Words Analysis - Analyze filler words
POST http://localhost:8008/api/v1/filler-words/5/analyze/

### Performance - Analyze users performance
POST http://localhost:8012/api/v1/performance/
Content-Type: application/json

